mpc_cuda -- authors and credits
================================

mpc_cuda is a CUDA port of the GNU multiple-precision stack so that
arbitrary-precision integer (mini-gmp), correctly-rounded floating-point (MPFR)
and complex (MPC) arithmetic run inside CUDA kernels.

Maintainer
----------
Tomonori Kouya  <tkouya@gmail.com>

Upstream libraries (transformed, not forked)
--------------------------------------------
mpc_cuda mechanically adapts pristine upstream sources with the transform
scripts in tools/.  Full credit for the multiple-precision arithmetic itself
belongs to the upstream projects:

  * GNU MP (mini-gmp)   https://gmplib.org/        -- the GMP developers
  * GNU MPFR            https://www.mpfr.org/      -- the MPFR team
  * GNU MPC             https://www.multiprecision.org/mpc/ -- A. Enge,
                                          M. Gastineau, P. Theveny, P. Zimmermann

See COPYING.LESSER and COPYING for the license terms.
